      "text": "Radio and television are electromagnetic distribution systems that achieved mass reach by exploiting spectrum as a shared resource. The regulatory and economic history is a case study in how a public good (spectrum) gets privatized, monopolized, disrupted, and re-disrupted — the same pattern as broadband, mobile, and cloud infrastructure."
